[32m+[m[32m# 🛒 ShopKart — MERN Stack E-Commerce Platform[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**ShopKart** is a full-stack e-commerce web application built using the MERN stack. It provides a seamless shopping experience with product browsing, wishlist management, cart functionality, secure authentication, and Razorpay payment integration.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m🌐 **Live Demo:** https://shop-kart-two-beta.vercel.app[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m📦 **GitHub Repository:** https://github.com/AbhayKumarMishra027/ShopKart[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## ✨ Features[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- **User Authentication** — Customer registration, login, logout, and protected routes.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Product Catalog** — Browse products and view detailed product information.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Search & Categories** — Find products using search and category filters.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Wishlist** — Save favourite products for later.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Shopping Cart** — Add, update, and remove products from the cart.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Checkout System** — Enter shipping details and initiate checkout.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Payment Integration** — Razorpay payment gateway integration with server-side signature verification.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Order Management** — View placed orders and track order status.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Image Management** — Cloudinary integration for product image storage.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Responsive Interface** — A clean shopping experience across supported devices.[m
[32m+[m
