[32m+[m[32m## 🚀 Run Locally[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Prerequisites[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Node.js and npm[m
[32m+[m[32m- MongoDB database[m
[32m+[m[32m- Cloudinary account[m
[32m+[m[32m- Razorpay account for payment integration[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### 1. Clone the repository[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```bash[m
[32m+[m[32mgit clone https://github.com/AbhayKumarMishra027/ShopKart.git[m
[32m+[m[32mcd ShopKart[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### 2. Configure the backend[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```bash[m
[32m+[m[32mcd backend[m
[32m+[m[32mnpm install[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCreate a `.env` file inside `backend/`:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```env[m
[32m+[m[32mPORT=3000[m
[32m+[m[32mNODE_ENV=development[m
[32m+[m[32mMONGO_URI=your_mongodb_connection_string[m
[32m+[m[32mJWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret[m
[32m+[m[32mCLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=your_cloudinary_cloud_name[m
[32m+[m[32mCLOUDINARY_API_KEY=your_cloudinary_api_key[m
[32m+[m[32mCLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=your_cloudinary_api_secret[m
[32m+[m[32mRAZORPAY_KEY_ID=your_razorpay_key_id[m
[32m+[m[32mRAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=your_razorpay_key_secret[m
[32m+[m[32mFRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:5173[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mStart the backend:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```bash[m
[32m+[m[32mnpm start[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### 3. Configure the frontend[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mOpen a separate terminal:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```bash[m
[32m+[m[32mcd frontend[m
[32m+[m[32mnpm install[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCreate a `.env` file inside `frontend/`:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```env[m
[32m+[m[32mVITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mStart the frontend:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```bash[m
[32m+[m[32mnpm run dev[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mOpen the local URL shown by Vite, usually `http://localhost:5173`.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 🔐 Security Notes[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Keep all secrets in environment variables.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Never commit `.env` files or payment credentials.[m
[32m+[m[32m- The frontend uses an API base URL to communicate with the backend.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Payment signatures are verified on the server before an order is marked as paid.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Protected endpoints require authentication.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 💳 Payment Integration[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mShopKart integrates Razorpay for checkout payments. The backend creates payment orders and verifies payment signatures before updating order and payment statuses.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mFor local testing, configure valid Razorpay credentials and follow Razorpay's testing guidelines. Never expose the Razorpay secret key in frontend code.[m
[32m+[m
